{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"rust-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Rust Snippets","description":"Structs, impls, traits, error handling, iterators, tests and async with Tokio.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Rust","path":"snippets/rust.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/rust.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fn ${1:name}(${2:args}) -> ${3:()} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Public function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pfn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"pub fn ${1:name}(${2:args}) -> ${3:()} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A public function\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"st\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[derive(Debug, Clone)]\",\n      \"pub struct ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tpub ${2:field}: ${3:String},\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"Impl\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"impl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"impl ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tpub fn new($2) -> Self {\",\n      \"\\t\\tSelf { $0 }\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An impl block\"\n  },\n  \"Trait\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"trait\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"pub trait ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tfn ${2:method}(&self) -> ${3:()};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A trait\"\n  },\n  \"Enum\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"enum\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[derive(Debug)]\",\n      \"pub enum ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:A},\",\n      \"\\t${3:B}(${4:String}),\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An enum\"\n  },\n  \"Match\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"match\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"match ${1:value} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:Some(x)} => $0,\",\n      \"\\t_ => {}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A match\"\n  },\n  \"If let\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"iflet\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if let ${1:Some(x)} = ${2:value} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if let\"\n  },\n  \"Result with ?\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"res\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fn ${1:name}() -> Result<${2:()}, ${3:Box<dyn std::error::Error>}> {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\tOk(())\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function returning Result\"\n  },\n  \"Test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"test\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[test]\",\n      \"fn ${1:name}() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A unit test\"\n  },\n  \"Test module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tmod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[cfg(test)]\",\n      \"mod tests {\",\n      \"\\tuse super::*;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\t#[test]\",\n      \"\\tfn ${1:works}() {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A tests module\"\n  },\n  \"Println\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"println!(\\\"${1:{}}\\\", ${2:value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"println!\"\n  },\n  \"Debug print\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dbg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"dbg!(${1:value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"dbg!\"\n  },\n  \"Iterator chain\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"iter\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.iter().filter(|${2:x}| $3).map(|${2:x}| $4).collect::<Vec<_>>()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An iterator chain\"\n  },\n  \"Tokio main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tokio\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[tokio::main]\",\n      \"async fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\tOk(())\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async main\"\n  },\n  \"Derive Serde\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"serde\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Serde derives\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Rust Snippets\n\nStructs, impls, traits, error handling, iterators, tests and async with Tokio.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 16 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Rust | `fn` | A function |\n| Rust | `pfn` | A public function |\n| Rust | `st` | A struct |\n| Rust | `impl` | An impl block |\n| Rust | `trait` | A trait |\n| Rust | `enum` | An enum |\n| Rust | `match` | A match |\n| Rust | `iflet` | if let |\n| Rust | `res` | A function returning Result |\n| Rust | `test` | A unit test |\n| Rust | `tmod` | A tests module |\n| Rust | `pl` | println! |\n| Rust | `dbg` | dbg! |\n| Rust | `iter` | An iterator chain |\n| Rust | `tokio` | An async main |\n| Rust | `serde` | Serde derives |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}